# Gastal Thrillseeker (2/3): "Start your engines!" "When this creature enters, it deals 1 damage to target opponent and you gain 1 life."
# "Max speed — This creature has deathtouch and haste." Turn 1: the first Gastal pings Bot2 (19) and Bot1 gains 1 (21), speed 1 then 2 as
# Bot2 lost life (CR 702.179a, 702.179d). Turn 3 a Lightning Bolt makes the speed 3: the Gastal attacks and Bot2's Hill Giant blocks it, taking
# 2 damage and surviving as there is no deathtouch yet while the Gastal dies. Turn 5 a second Gastal's own enter trigger pings Bot2 and takes
# the speed to 4: it has deathtouch and haste, so it attacks at once, and the Hill Giant that blocks it dies to its 2 damage (CR 702.2b)
# while the Gastal dies to the Giant's 3.

